    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/1432cd8c5082a12c2c077b27e618d6df.avif?t=1754123627\" /></div><br><br><strong>Wouldn't you like to play with dangerous prisoners, make them suffer defeat and humiliation, and have your heart broken by their darkness?<br>&quot;Romp of Dump&quot; is the perfect game for women who want to enjoy such immorality.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/d239d93c7778086cbd81e013c523d25a.webp?t=1754123627\" /></div><br><br>Players, as death row inmates falsely accused of being serial killers, attempt to communicate with abnormal criminal prisoners through &quot;betting cards&quot;.<br><br><strong>A &quot;penalty game&quot; for losers!</strong>\u3000Beat the dangerous prisoners, dent their pride, and collect the episodes told in the Penalty Game to unravel the bizarre crimes they committed.<br><br>This is a bromance visual novel that offers the immoral experience of a public execution.<br>The saved data from the demo version can be carried over to the full version.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/203d7d5693665068b1b183d0f74124cb.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/203d7d5693665068b1b183d0f74124cb.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/203d7d5693665068b1b183d0f74124cb.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It includes four casino-style mini-games, including &quot;Blackjack,&quot; and a visual novel tailored to short stories.<br><br>The ability to recognize small gestures and changes in facial expressions and dialogue of unique characters determines the winner, allowing players to enjoy playing games against the CPU.<br><br>Streamers can get excited by predicting the score with their viewers!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/67905eb4466fc3d0cf12116f61fa1922.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/67905eb4466fc3d0cf12116f61fa1922.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/67905eb4466fc3d0cf12116f61fa1922.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Live2D animated standing drawings with a high range of motion animate a variety of facial expressions and gestures to color the conversational drama.<br>The total number of motions for all characters is more than 200, and each character has more than 100 different facial expressions!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/e44b7ff3e074d5175af3dd1794e47707.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/e44b7ff3e074d5175af3dd1794e47707.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/e44b7ff3e074d5175af3dd1794e47707.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The scenario is a massive volume of over 200,000 words in all.<br>It can be played casually or in depth by collecting numerous branches and delving deeply into the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/70623ef952ce2d60c2bc3e5a787d14a3.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/70623ef952ce2d60c2bc3e5a787d14a3.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/70623ef952ce2d60c2bc3e5a787d14a3.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The main scenario is a suspense story about a bizarre crime.<br>Gathering information and hypotheses about the case and unraveling the truth with your own hands, the development is sure to be exciting as you anticipate the true story!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Live Game Streaming and Fan Art Guidelines\u3011</h2>&quot;Romp of Dump&quot; welcomes game distribution and fan art!<br>I welcome both individuals and corporations to distribute and monetize their work without permission.<br>There are no restrictions on spoilers, and you can distribute up to the end of the story.<br>When submitting videos, please include the name of the game and a link to the official website or Steam store page.<br>When submitting fan art, we would appreciate it if you could clearly state the name of the work and use the hashtag #RompOfDump<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Story\u3011</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/6be6992dcaa735121efa3c317bff8590.avif?t=1754123627\" /></div><br><br>1992, Dumpir, a city of pleasure and immorality.<br>When this place, threatened by the shadow of a serial killer, was still called paradise....<br>The Dumpir Prison, called the &quot;Dump,&quot; is a cesspool where those who misbehave in the city at night are thrown in.<br>There was a bored death row prisoner there\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/07cb3f7d88fddfcff74f743ea963d52f.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/07cb3f7d88fddfcff74f743ea963d52f.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/07cb3f7d88fddfcff74f743ea963d52f.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Hi, I'm &quot;As K. Nightmare&quot;. You can call me &quot;K-Nnight&quot; if you like.<br>I'm not comfortable with the idea of sitting back and waiting to be executed for a crime I didn't commit, so I'm thinking of playing cards with all the prisoners.<br>The loser gets a penalty game...well, let me tell you a funny story.<br>Like what crime they came to this prison for...?<br><br>The key to winning is to recognize the quirks of characters animated in Live2D.<br>Play with the scum prisoners in a new type of card game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010CHARACTER\u3011</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/9087e93db2196cc73cd0a383f3d65ee8.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/9087e93db2196cc73cd0a383f3d65ee8.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/9087e93db2196cc73cd0a383f3d65ee8.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>As K. Nightmare</strong><br><i>Well, I'm a guy who has XXX with everyone... but I don't remember having XXX with any goddess of the law, okay?</i><br>Charges: Serial murder and XXXX<br>Sentence: Death penalty<br>The protagonist of this story.<br>He was falsely convicted and sentenced to death.<br>He is a man with a dangerous charm that captivates people.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/da3177bd80dcbbe6c6b99c2405320067.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/da3177bd80dcbbe6c6b99c2405320067.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/da3177bd80dcbbe6c6b99c2405320067.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Louq\uff1dGoodman</strong><br><i>Oh, uh, you know. I'm Lou, Lou... Louq. Ah! &quot;Louq&quot;, not &quot;Looouq&quot;...!</i><br><br>Charges: murder, abandonment of a corpse<br>Sentence: 2 years and 6 months<br>An exemplary person to be bullied. He seems harmless by all accounts.<br>He is a &quot;37 year old kid&quot; who acts healthy despite his difficulties in life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3ef069df5df33e181cd5a3009c2ada2e.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3ef069df5df33e181cd5a3009c2ada2e.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3ef069df5df33e181cd5a3009c2ada2e.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Faye</strong><br><i>My name is Master Faye!\u3000I'm the worst, worst, worst hitman of ACIDD, the Tamayuran Mafia, remember that!</i><br><br>Charges: murder, aggravated assault<br>Sentence: 70 years<br>Despite his neutral appearance, he is a troublemaker with a constant stream of extreme words and actions.<br>His empty head is filled with murderous intent and cruelty.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/6d9c01efb4a3663b8e4fdcaa3b1946a1.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/6d9c01efb4a3663b8e4fdcaa3b1946a1.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/6d9c01efb4a3663b8e4fdcaa3b1946a1.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Durum De Milo</strong><br><i>We are what the guards call us by number. We are each other's cesspool trash and need no further relationship.</i><br><br>Charges: bodily injury, confinement<br>Sentence: 22 years<br>A taciturn loner who hates to get along with others.<br>He appears to be a sensible man, but his words and actions reveal a deep darkness.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3b81a188fbe34c5918bfb99aad2455f5.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3b81a188fbe34c5918bfb99aad2455f5.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/3b81a188fbe34c5918bfb99aad2455f5.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Franbel Ripstein</strong><br><i>I followed my beliefs and did the right thing. That's the decisive difference between me and you scum...</i><br><br>Charges: Damage to dead body<br>Sentence: 3 years of imprisonment<br>He is calm, proud and fastidious.<br>He was an excellent doctor before his arrest and despises other prisoners as &quot;Lowlife&quot;.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/a7ace8e5ba5749e328f8b179704c1295.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/a7ace8e5ba5749e328f8b179704c1295.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/a7ace8e5ba5749e328f8b179704c1295.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Drake O Mojita</strong><br><i>Well, you can lick it all you want. Someday I'll make you understand that it's a terrible poison...</i><br><br>Charges: Drug trafficking, murder<br>Sentence: 25 years in prison<br>He is a drug dealer known as &quot;Little Draco&quot;.<br>He is a charlatan who loves money, but is also rumored to be ruthless and sharp.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/1432cd8c5082a12c2c077b27e618d6df.avif?t=1754123627\" /></div><br><br><strong>Wouldn't you like to play with dangerous prisoners, make them suffer defeat and humiliation, and have your heart broken by their darkness?<br>&quot;Romp of Dump&quot; is the perfect game for women who want to enjoy such immorality.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.poster.avif?t=1754123627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.webm?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/65739d3a87b7f3cf6ca06416fa074b29.mp4?t=1754123627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1951520/extras/d239d93c7778086cbd81e013c523d25a.webp?t=1754123627\" /></div><br><br>Players, as death row inmates falsely accused of being serial killers, attempt to communicate with abnormal criminal prisoners through &quot;betting cards&quot;.<br><br><strong>A &quot;penalty game&quot; for losers!</strong>\u3000Beat the dangerous prisoners, dent their pride, and collect the episodes told in the Penalty Game to unravel the bizarre crimes they committed.<br><br>This is a bromance visual novel that offers the immoral experience of a public execution.<br>The saved data from the demo version can be carried over to the full version.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app